<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-PANTANI WINS 13TH STAGE OF THE TOUR DE FRANCE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-PANTANI WINS 13TH STAGE OF THE TOUR DE FRANCE.</headline>
<dateline>L'ALPE D'HUEZ, France 1997-07-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marco Pantani of Italy won the 13th stage of the Tour de France over 203.5 kms from St Etienne to L'Alpe d'Huez on Saturday.</p>
<p>Jan Ullrich of Germany retained the overall leader's yellow jersey.</p>
